<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/4/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 3 the following section: Appoint- 3. (1) The Yang di-Pertuan Agong may appoint a ment of Director General and a Deputy Director General of Director General National Registration for the purposes of the Act. and Deputy (2) Subject to the general direction and control of Director General. the Minister, the Director General may exercise the powers conferred, and shall perform the duties imposed, upon him by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/4/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/4/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/4/eng@/~cl_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/4/eng@> .
